.TH NN-COMPAT 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-compat \- runtime and operator compatibility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn compat [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check operators against a runtime capability table.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-runtime NAME
Runtime name.
.TP
.B \-\-runtime\-version VER
Capability table version.
.TP
.B \-\-target NAME
Hardware target (alias).
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 compatible; 1 incompatible.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn compat model.onnx --runtime onnxruntime
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-target(1), nn-backends(1)
